[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node ug-eco-terminal" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                   &lt;div class="ug-ecosystem-support" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h4 class="ug-ecosystem-subtitle" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Supporting Capabilities&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                       &lt;div class="ug-support-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Detects coverage gaps, orphan tests, and drift as the codebase evolves.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Estimates regression scope and identifies high-risk changes across the project.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Reviews AI-generated implementation changes for alignment and quality concerns.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Maps Azure DevOps work items to pull requests, commits, and source files — delivery governance evidence chain.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.37]       &#xD;
