[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/task-alignment&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/implementation-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Map ADO work items to code changes&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/implementation-traceability&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Run compliance, audit, and readiness packs&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/quality-review&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/frontend-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Frontend Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Unified performance, security, accessibility, and standards review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/frontend-quality-review&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/api-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;API Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review backend/API quality&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/api-quality-review&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/integration-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review integration readiness&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/integration-quality-review&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/ai-change-auditor" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review AI-generated changes&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-ai" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI REVIEW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/ai-change-auditor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Configure platform settings&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-admin" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/admin/system-settings&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Sidebar menu visibility is controlled from &lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt; → &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility&lt;/strong&gt;. Disabled modules keep their implementation, routes, and components intact, but they are hidden from the main menu until an admin enables them.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]               &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]           &lt;section id="scenarios" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Helpful Scenarios&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Common questions and the features that answer them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]               &lt;div class="ug-scenario-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to understand the governance rules that apply to my project.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/constitution-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Review the rule catalog before anything else&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to review a specification.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Extract requirements, AC, and review coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to load a sample project.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/sample-projects" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Load supported artifacts, then verify the workspace banner before opening explorer pages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to review an implementation plan.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/plan-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Check ADRs, phases, gates, and risks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to see whether requirements are connected to tasks.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/artifact-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Load all four artifacts for full-chain analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to know whether governance rules are covered.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Select the Constitution Compliance (Governance) pack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to know what is missing across my artifacts.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Select the QA Auditor (Quality) pack — deterministic, no AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to know if the feature is ready for development, testing, or release.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Select the Delivery Readiness (Readiness) pack for three-gate go/no-go&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to know if the feature is ready from a QA perspective.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Select the QA Readiness (Readiness) pack for scored readiness gates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to review AI-generated changes.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/ai-change-auditor" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Disabled by default; enable AI Change Review in System Settings → Feature Visibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to check implementation task alignment against the spec.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/task-alignment" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Align tasks.md to spec.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to see what changed in the spec between versions.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/spec-drift" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Changes tab tracks specification comparison history&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to assess the regression impact of a change.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/impact-analysis" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Scope regression and identify high-risk areas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to check security, performance, and accessibility of my deployed frontend.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/frontend-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Frontend Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Configure a frontend analysis profile in System Settings first&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to verify that ADO work items are linked to code changes.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/implementation-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Enter work item IDs from Azure DevOps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to link source code files to requirements.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/code-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Code Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Legacy Traceability navigation is hidden by default; enable it from Feature Visibility if your team still uses it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to enable or disable features for my team.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Use the Feature Visibility tab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-scenario-q" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;I want to validate canonical ReviewContext metrics.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.40]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;div class="ug-scenario-a" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="ug-scenario-note" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt; — Developer-only: open Developer → ReviewContext Validation in Development mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]           &lt;section id="discovery" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Discovery&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Several powerful analysis views are embedded as tabs inside existing workflows — they do not have dedicated menu items. This section tells you exactly where to find each one and how to activate it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Key rule:&lt;/strong&gt; Run analysis first, then explore the result tabs. Once analysis completes, switching between tabs does not require re-uploading files — the session is preserved automatically.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-table-scroll" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;table class="ug-table" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;thead b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Found Inside&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Route&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How To Access&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;tbody b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/extract&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analyse a spec → active by default in Analysis Results&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Flow View&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/extract&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analyse a spec → click &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Flow View&lt;/strong&gt; tab in Analysis Results&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Explorer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/extract&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analyse a spec → click &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Explorer&lt;/strong&gt; tab in Analysis Results&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/task-alignment&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analyse spec.md + tasks.md → click &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Testing&lt;/strong&gt; tab in results&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" id="disc-spec-explorer" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Explorer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; Spec Explorer is the specification structure and navigation layer. Use it to understand how the specification is organized, browse sections and headings, see which artifacts belong to each section, identify healthy versus unhealthy sections, and navigate into Traceability.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How to access:&lt;/strong&gt; Run analysis on &lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;, then click the &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Explorer&lt;/strong&gt; tab in the Analysis Results area.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When to use:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Navigating a large or complex specification by structure rather than by extracted item&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Seeing section health, including requirements, tests, clarifications, coverage percentage, and explicit Covered, Partial, or Missing labels&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Understanding User Story ownership without expanding every section&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Opening a requirement or section and jumping into Traceability when coverage needs deeper analysis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Role clarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage is for coverage analysis. Flow View is for QA readiness. Spec Explorer is for specification structure and navigation.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" id="disc-flow-view" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Flow View&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; A QA Readiness dashboard for User Stories. Flow View groups requirements, acceptance tests, success criteria, and implementation tasks by user story — and surfaces gaps, readiness status, and QA Ready scores without requiring manual inspection of each story. It answers: &lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Which User Stories are ready for QA and release?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How to access:&lt;/strong&gt; Run analysis on &lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;, then click the &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Flow View&lt;/strong&gt; tab in the Analysis Results area.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h4 class="ug-feature-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Story Readiness Status&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Ready&lt;/strong&gt; — requirements, tests, success criteria, and implementation links are present.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;At Risk&lt;/strong&gt; — tests exist, but success criteria or implementation links are missing.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Blocked&lt;/strong&gt; — requirements are missing linked acceptance tests.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" id="disc-traceability-view" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage (Analysis Tab)&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; Shows the QA risk picture first: coverage status, missing tests, orphan tests, missing success criteria, missing user story mappings, and relationship gaps. This is the &lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;default&lt;/em&gt; view shown after analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How to access:&lt;/strong&gt; Run analysis on &lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;. The Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage tab is active by default in Analysis Results.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage vs. Artifact Traceability:&lt;/strong&gt; Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage shows relationships &lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;within the specification&lt;/em&gt; (requirements to tests). &lt;a href="/artifact-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/a&gt; shows relationships &lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;across all four artifacts&lt;/em&gt; (Constitution → Spec → Plan → Tasks).&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage vs. QA Artifact Library:&lt;/strong&gt; Coverage analysis belongs in Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage. The QA Artifact Library is a repository for reusable QA assets that teams can discover and reuse after review; it is not the place where coverage health is calculated.
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Click a health summary card, such as Missing User Stories or Missing Success Criteria, to open the Gaps tab as a focused QA work queue.&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;h4 class="ug-feature-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Gap Categories&lt;/h4&gt;
        &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Missing User Story:&lt;/strong&gt; A coverage requirement is not mapped to a User Story.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Missing Success Criteria:&lt;/strong&gt; A coverage requirement has no linked measurable outcome.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Missing Tests:&lt;/strong&gt; A coverage requirement has no linked acceptance tests.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Orphan Tests:&lt;/strong&gt; A test exists but is not linked to any coverage requirement.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" id="disc-task-explorer" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task Explorer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; Task Explorer is the &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Coverage&lt;/strong&gt; workspace. It answers whether the specification is being implemented: which requirements have tasks, which requirements are missing implementation, and where delivery risk exists.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How to access:&lt;/strong&gt; Task Explorer has its own menu item in the REVIEW section (&lt;a href="/task-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/task-explorer&lt;/a&gt;). It is also available as an enriched tab inside Implementation Review after a full analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]           &lt;section id="ai-dev" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-Assisted Development&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Review Studio supports teams using AI to accelerate implementation. AI Review is disabled by default; enable AI Change Review from System Settings → Feature Visibility when your team needs an AI-assisted post-generation review.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-ai-flow-row" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-node-label" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;div class="ug-ai-node-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance rules, policies, quality standards&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-node-label" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;div class="ug-ai-node-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Requirements, user stories, acceptance criteria&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-node-label" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan + Tasks&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;div class="ug-ai-node-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Architecture decisions, phases, implementation tasks&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-node ug-ai-node-terminal" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-node-label" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;div class="ug-ai-node-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Compliance, audit, and readiness gates in one run&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;div class="ug-ai-concepts" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-concept" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-concept-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification-First Development&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Every task and implementation decision traces back to a requirement. QA Review Studio enforces this by surfacing alignment gaps early using Artifact Traceability and Implementation Review.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-concept" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-concept-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer establishes the governance rule set. Quality Review's Constitution Compliance pack verifies that all artifacts comply with those rules before development begins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-concept" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-concept-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability maintains a complete chain from governance rule to implementation task. Quality Review's QA Auditor pack identifies missing traceability links with deterministic rule-based findings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;div class="ug-ai-concept" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ai-concept-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Readiness&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review's QA Readiness and Delivery Readiness packs aggregate all analysis outputs into scored readiness gates — clearing the team to proceed with confidence through Development, Testing, and Release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Tip:&lt;/strong&gt; When using AI to generate tasks from a spec, run Implementation Review immediately after to catch any tasks that introduce undocumented behavior. Then run Quality Review to surface rule-based findings across the full artifact set.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]           &lt;section id="validation" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validation&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer/admin validation tools verify that the runtime workspace and canonical ReviewContext metrics are coherent before relying on downstream analysis results.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;ReviewContext Validation&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Where:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt; → Developer → ReviewContext Validation. This developer-only section is visible in Development mode and is intended for admins and maintainers, not normal end-user workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; It validates the canonical ReviewContext created from loaded workspace artifacts and compares its metrics with downstream analysis sources. Use it when diagnosing inconsistent counts, missing artifacts, or suspected parser/traceability regressions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-table-scroll" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;table class="ug-table" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;thead b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Status&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Meaning&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Typical action&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                       &lt;tbody b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;PASS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Canonical ReviewContext metrics and available downstream comparisons are consistent.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Proceed with review, analysis, and quality checks.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;WARNING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validation ran but some context is incomplete, unavailable, or only partially comparable.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Check which artifacts are loaded and whether partial-workspace behavior is expected.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                           &lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;FAIL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A canonical metric or downstream comparison is inconsistent enough to block trust in the result.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                               &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Treat as a developer investigation item before relying on affected analysis output.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h4 class="ug-feature-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace behavior&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Empty workspace:&lt;/strong&gt; The section shows a helpful empty state and validation reports that no ReviewContext is available. Load supported artifacts first.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Partial workspace:&lt;/strong&gt; Validation still runs against the artifacts that are loaded. Missing artifact metrics may appear as warnings or zero counts; this is expected for focused reviews.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Loaded workspace:&lt;/strong&gt; The Loaded Artifacts table lists constitution.md, spec.md, plan.md, tasks.md, and data-model.md status before validation results are reviewed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;h4 class="ug-feature-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Exports&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Export JSON:&lt;/strong&gt; Copies the full validation report for debugging, automated comparison, or issue attachment.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Export HTML:&lt;/strong&gt; Copies a readable report that can be shared with maintainers or included in a diagnostic note.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Screenshots:&lt;/strong&gt; The User Guide currently does not embed screenshots for navigation, Feature Visibility, Sample Projects, review pages, analysis pages, or System Settings. No screenshot replacements are required in this page.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]               &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.41]       &#xD;
