[xUnit.net 00:00:02.46]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Detects coverage gaps, orphan tests, and drift as the codebase evolves.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.46]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.46]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Estimates regression scope and identifies high-risk changes across the project.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
